      "arenaLabPresetId": "f2-don-paco",
      "arenaLabEvidence": "Verified in the canonical combat arena preset `f2-don-paco` with deterministic observation: frame 539 (8983.33ms) has no cue/banner/projectiles/zones. Frame 540 (9000ms) starts the locked hostile-red cone telegraph with exact `THE BIG GOB \u2014 Don Paco's painting the whole block!` announcement and visible cone/path/landing-circle diff. Frame 624 (10400ms) resolves the cast and launches 5 committed projectiles. Frame 654 (10900ms) all 5 impacts resolve into 5 persistent slicks on the committed landing circles; frame 655 confirms the slick set persists after impact. Frame 894 (14900ms) the first slick set fully expires and cleans up. Frame 1278 (21300ms) the second cast's 5 impacts/slicks resolve at the same committed cadence. Headless cadence/impact proof is covered by `scripts/agent/don-paco-arena-evidence.ts`; deterministic runtime coverage in `tests/unit/mob-abilities/big-gob.test.ts` covers inside/outside damage plus while-inside-only slow + 4s expiry; browser observation is in `tests/e2e/don-paco-arena-observation.test.ts`. Production remains blocked behind `floor2-boss-production-enable`.",
      "animationLabState": "not-required",
      "animationLabEvidence": null,
      "implementationIssue": {
        "kind": "issue",
        "number": 1952,
