      "arenaLabPresetId": "f2-queen-mab",
      "arenaLabEvidence": "Verified in the canonical combat arena preset `f2-queen-mab` via deterministic headless Chromium observation (`tests/e2e/queen-mab-arena-observation.test.ts`): frame 539 (8983.33ms) shows no cue/banner; frame 540 (9000ms) shows the first telegraph, exact `VERDIGRIS GLAMOUR \u2014 All that glitters will corrode!` announcement, and a visible render diff in both the telegraph footprint and top-center HUD banner. Frame 630 (10500ms): first cast resolves, cueCount drops to 0, player is Tarnished (confirmed via statusEffectsByEntity), resolution burst changes pixels in the centre. Frame 870 (14500ms): Tarnished debuff expires, indicator Graphics cleaned up from scene display list (graphicsCount decreased). Frame 1170 (19500ms): second telegraph starts, cueCount=1, Tarnished still absent. Frame 1260 (21000ms): second cast resolves, cueCount drops to 0, player re-Tarnished. Full two-cast cadence with Tarnished apply/expiry/cleanup/re-apply confirmed. Headless canonical-runtime cadence also covered by scripts/agent/queen-mab-arena-evidence.ts and tests/unit/mob-abilities/verdigris-glamour.test.ts.",
